    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nebukadineza na shilooti sha ntī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntemi Nebukadineza: Kū banhū bose, mahanga, na banhū ba ndīmi jose abo bakikalaga ū mu sī: Nalīmulombela ng'wīlūkīlwe no no no!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalī na būyegi no ū kūng'wigwīlīja ī ya shimanīkījo na sha kūkumya īsho wanīītīlile ū Mulungu wa higūlya no.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shimanīkījo shakwe shilī shitaale no,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene Nebukadineza naalī mu kaya ng'wikūlū lyane, naalī natī na būgeehelwa mu shose shose, hangī naalī na kwīīlūkīlwa kūtaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakaloota shilooti shūnogohya no; naalī nalaalile mu būlīīlī bone, maganiko na shakoolechiwa shūyūbīta ū mu ntwe gwane, shūnogohya no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nūlagīja benhwe pye a ba masala ba mu Babuloni, bize banishomelegeje ī shilooti shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho biza a bafumu na a bachūja na a baloji ba sonda na a baboni, nūbalotoolela ī shilooti; alīyo būlemeelwa ū kūnishomelegeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose wiza nū Danyeli (lina līngī Belitishaza, kū lina lya ng'wa mulungu wane, nīyo alī na moyo gwa bamulungu beela ū mulī we); ūshika wīmīīla kū būtongi bone, nūnotoolela nang'hwe ī shilooti shenīsho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūng'wīla, “Belitishaza ntaale wa bafumu, namanile gīkī ū mulī bebe gūlīmo moyo gwa bamulungu beela, na ītīho mbisīla ndaamu ū kūlī bebe. Alilūūlū, shiishi ī shilooti shane, nishomelegejage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakoolechiwa īsho naashibonaga aho nalaalile mu būlīīlī shiishi, aho nalolile nahayagimanīla nabona ū kū būtongi wane ntī gūzwile ha gatī gītī ya sī. Gwalī ntī ntaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntī gwenūyo gūūkūla hangī gūūhangaala no, ī neno yago yūkuumya kū malunde, kūshisha kū ngelelo ya sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A madūūtū gago gaalī masoga no, nī shisuumo shingī kīngī nasho, nīyo a ha ntī gwenūyo shalīho shilīwa sha kūlisha shiseeng'wa shose pye. Ū mu sīlīlī yaago ī ndimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ndimu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nī shiinu jilīmo ū ng'wigelè lyenīlī; nū lūhī 14.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ja mu masaka jalī na wifuulīlo, ī noni ja kūlala najo jūpandīka wikalo ū mu matambī gago; būlī shiseeng'wa shūyūlīīla henaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo ū mu shakoolechiwa īsho naalī nashibona nalaalile mu būlīīlī, aho nataalī nalolile, ū kū būtongi bone nūbona ntūng'wa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ntūng'wa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, malaika; nī ng'hī 17,23.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ng'wela alika kūfuma ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūhīlīka n'ilaka lya higūlya, ‘Gūbbutagi ū ntī, mugakongoole a matambī gago; na a madūūtū gago mugahūlūle shisambaale ī shisuumo shaago. Ī ndimu jīnge ū mu mbeho yaago, nī noni ū mu matambī gago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī līshikī līlekagi, ni lītungagwe chūma na shaba, likale mu maswa ga mu malaale, ī miji yalyo īlī hasī. Nekagi alobiwe lūme lwa kūfuma kwigūlū, ikale hamò na ndimu mu madīīlo ga mu masaka ga mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī ng'holò yakwe īgalūke yīnge ī ya munhū inhwe ya nyalimu, kūshisha makanza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makanza:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, myaka; nū mu ng'hī 23,25,32.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mpungatī gabīte alī kwenūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū mhayo gwenūyū gwahayiagwa na balang'hani beela, h'abo baafunyaga ū būlamuji; a bapanga badeebe gīkī ū Ū wa Higūlya no hū ng'wene ū nsugi wa mabūtemi ga banhū, na akang'winhaga ose ose ūyo ūntogwa we; na akatūūlaga basugi abo badalahilwe na banhū bose.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī shenīshi h'ī shilooti īsho naalootaga ū nene Ntemi Nebukadineza. Alilūūlū Belitishaza, niwīlage shilī na makūlū kī; nguno ū mu banhū ba masala abo bal'ū mu būsugi bone atīho nūūlū ūmò ūyo addūgije ū kūnishomelegeja. Alīyo ū bebe ūdūgije, nguno ū mulī bebe gūlīmo moyo gwa bamulungu beela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Danyeli kūshomeleja shilooti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Danyeli (lina līngī Belitishaza) ūzwangana gete kakanza ho, a maganiko gakwe gūng'ogohya. Hūna ū ntemi ūng'wīla, “Bebe Belitishaza, ī shilooti shitizūkūkoya nūūlū a makūlū gasho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Belitishaza ūshosha, “Baba nkūjiwa, yalī hambū hambū ī shilooti shenīshi ūlū ni shitūngīīlile kū banishi bako, na a makūlū gasho kū bilwisha bako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntī ūyo wagūbonaga, hūna gūūkūla gūūhangaala, ī neno yago yūkuumya kū malunde, kūshisha gūyūlolelwa na kū ngelelo ya sī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo gwalī na madūūtū masoga, na shisuumo shingī kūlwa shilīwa sha kūlisha pyī ī shiseeng'wa, na ha kwifuulīla ndimu ja mu masaka, na būbeegejo wa chanjo ū mu matambī gago kūlwa noni ja kūlala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baba ntemi, ū bebe hū ūl'ū ntī gwenūyo! Nguno ū bebe ūlī ntaale no, hangī ūlī na nguzu; ū būtaale wako ī haha būkīlanīgije kūshisha būshikile kū malunde; nū būsugi wako būsambaalile kūshisha kū mapande ga kū ngelelo ya sī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
