              "DAN.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alilūūlū baba ntemi, a makūlū gaya, nī shilagīlo shakwe Ūyo alī Higūlya no shiishi, īsho wamalile kūshifunya kūlwa nkūjiwa ū ntemi wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūpeejiwa ū mu banhū, ūkikale hamò na ndimu ja mu masaka, ūyūlya maswa gītī mitugo, na kūlobiwa lūme lwa kūfuma kwigūlū. Gakūbīta makanza mpungatī ūlī kwenūko, kūshisha ūdeebe gīkī Ūyo alī Higūlya no hū ng'wene ū nsugi wa mabūtemi ga banhū, na akang'winhaga ose ose ūyo antogilwe we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shilagīlo sha kūlekwa ishikī lya ntī nī miji yalyo, shilī na makūlū ga gīkī ū būtemi wako ūkūshokejiwa ūlū ūdeeba hape gīkī ū būsugi būfumile ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū baba ntemi, zunyaga nakūganikīle: Lekanaga nasho ī shibi shako wandye kwīta ya būtūngīlīja, nū būbi oye, ūbize na shigongo ū kū banhū abo bakwiboneelagwa. Hamo ū mu gīko ī mhola yako īkongeja kwikala ho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
